# Gradle build output/caches (Fabric/Forge modules) — large (Loom's cache alone can be 50-100MB+,
# including cached Minecraft jars), fully regeneratable from source, and machine-specific. The
# actual deliverable jars belong in releases/ (via release.sh), not here.
**/.gradle/
**/build/

# Same idea for Maven modules, going forward — note this does NOT retroactively untrack
# paper/target/, which was already committed before this file existed; it only stops NEW Maven
# modules from being tracked the same way.
**/target/
